atus":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p010:m0467","surface":"元顯","start":467,"end":469,"person_id":"c03_362_4d7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p010:m0470","surface":"明帝","start":470,"end":472,"person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p010:m0493","surface":"王珣","start":493,"end":495,"person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p010:m0499","surface":"謝琰","start":499,"end":501,"person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_BA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p010:m0504","surface":"桓之才","start":504,"end":507,"person_id":"9b0_sw0_4yv","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p010:m0508","surface":"毛泰","start":508,"end":510,"person_id":"iwe_yvq_4c8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p010:m0511","surface":"高素","start":511,"end":513,"person_id":"761_579_e10","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi","book_id":"b-jinshu-064","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-064-simadaozi-ws2622004"},{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simadaozi:p015","text":"大軍將發，玄從兄驃騎長史石生馳使告玄。玄進次尋陽，傳檄京師，罪狀元顯。俄而玄至西陽，帝戎服餞元顯于西池，始登舟而玄至新亭。元顯棄船退屯國子學堂。明日，列陣于宣陽門外，元顯佐吏多散走。或言玄已至大桁，劉牢之遂降于玄。元顯回入宣陽門，牢之參軍張暢之率眾遂之，眾潰。元顯奔入相府，唯張法順隨之。問計于道子，道子對之泣。玄遣太傅從事中郎毛泰收元顯送於新亭，縛於舫前而數之。元顯答曰：「為王誕、張法順所誤。」於是送付廷尉，並其六子皆害之。玄又奏：「道子酣縱不孝，當棄市。」詔徒安成郡，使御史杜竹林防衛，竟承玄旨酖殺之，時年三十九。帝三日哭於西堂。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":141,"last_line":141,"raw_start":11943,"raw_end":12213,"raw_character_offsets":[11945,11946,11947,11948,11949,11950,11951,11952,11953,11954,11955,11956,11957,11958,11959,11960,11961,11962,11963,11964,11965,11966,11967,11968,11969,11970,11971,11972,11973,11974,11975,11976,11977,11978,11979,11980,11981,11982,11983,1